flowchart TD
    CSV[Kaggle CSV 1M rows / upload / local sample] --> PRE[P1 Preprocessing<br/>mapping, cleaning, drop protected fields]
    PRE --> SYN[P1 Synthetic enrichment<br/>deterministic, labelled]
    SYN --> DB[(SQLite)]
    DEMO[P1 Labelled demo customers] --> DB
    DB --> PROF[P1 Profile builder<br/>+ data-quality gate]
    PROF --> SEG[P2 Segmentation engine<br/>segmentation.yaml]
    KB[9 synthetic policy docs] --> IDX[P2 Chunk + embed<br/>ST or TF-IDF / Chroma or local]
    IDX --> RAG[P2 Retriever]
    SEG --> STRAT[P3 Strategy selector<br/>suppression: consent, cooldown, duplicate, overdue]
    CAT[P3 Approved offer catalog<br/>offers.yaml] --> STRAT
    STRAT -->|blocked: DATA/POLICY| BLK[Draft BLOCKED<br/>LLM never called]
    STRAT --> GEN[P3 LLM email generator<br/>placeholders for facts]
    RAG -->|tone/wording guidance| GEN
    GEN --> VAL{P4 Deterministic validator<br/>16+ checks}
    VAL -->|WRITING| REP[Targeted repair prompt<br/>max 2]
    VAL -->|FORMAT| RETRY[Format retry x1]
    REP --> VAL
    RETRY --> VAL
    VAL -->|DATA/POLICY| BLK
    VAL -->|repairs exhausted| FB[Static approved template] --> VAL2{Validate again}
    VAL2 -->|fail| BLK
    VAL -->|pass| JUDGE[Optional LLM tone judge<br/>advisory WARN only]
    VAL2 -->|pass| JUDGE
    JUDGE --> REV[P4 Human review<br/>approve / edit+revalidate / reject / regenerate]
    REV -->|approve| GATE{P4 Pre-send gate<br/>re-validate with fresh data}
    GATE -->|paid / consent withdrawn| CAN[CANCELLED / BLOCKED]
    GATE -->|ok| MAIL[P4 Mock email service<br/>MOCK_SENT, no real email]
    RAG --> QA[P2 Customer policy Q&A]
    PROF --> QA
    MAIL --> AUD[(P4 Audit + observability<br/>append-only, PII-redacted)]
    REV --> AUD
    VAL --> AUD
    BLK --> AUD
